{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19671","headline":"道州敬酬何处士书情见赠 · 吕温","name":"道州敬酬何处士书情见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"意气曾倾四国豪，偶来幽寺息尘劳。\n严陵钓处江初满，梁甫吟时月正高。\n新识几人知杞梓，故园何岁长蓬蒿。\n期君自致青云上，不用伤心叹二毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}